{
  "title": "ELB / ALB / NLB · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "여러 대상에 요청 또는 연결을 분산하는 로드 밸런서다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>ELB <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Load Balancing)</span> / ALB <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Load Balancer)</span> / NLB <span class=\"full-name\">(Network Load Balancer)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#comparison\">비교표</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">Application Load Balancer</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#network-load-balancer\">Network Load Balancer</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#gateway-load-balancer\">Gateway Load Balancer</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#classic-load-balancer\">Classic Load Balancer</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#listeners-and-target-groups\">Listeners and Target Groups</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#internet-facing-and-internal\">Internet-facing and Internal</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#cross-zone-load-balancing\">Cross-zone Load Balancing</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#tls-stickiness-and-deregistration\">TLS, Stickiness and Deregistration</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>컴퓨팅</span><span>23 / 62</span></div><h1>ELB <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Load Balancing)</span> / ALB <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Load Balancer)</span> / NLB <span class=\"full-name\">(Network Load Balancer)</span></h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 8 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Elastic Load Balancing은 여러 건강한 Target에 Traffic을 분산하는 관리형 서비스다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#network-load-balancer\">NLB</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#gateway-load-balancer\">GWLB</a>와 이전 세대 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#classic-load-balancer\">CLB</a>는 처리 Layer와 사용 목적이 다르다.</p><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#listeners-and-target-groups\">Listener</a>가 요청을 받고 Rule이 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#listeners-and-target-groups\">Target Group</a>으로 전달한다. Target Health, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 배치와 앱의 연결·세션 특성을 함께 구성해야 장애 시 정상 Target으로 전환할 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"Layer 7과 Layer 4 Routing\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>Layer 7과 Layer 4 Routing</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Application Load Balancer</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> request</strong><small>Host·Path·Header</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#listeners-and-target-groups\">Listener</a> rules</strong><small>지원 조건 평가</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#listeners-and-target-groups\">Target Group</a></strong><small>앱별 요청 분산</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Network Load Balancer</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>TCP <span class=\"full-name\">(Transmission Control Protocol)</span> / UDP <span class=\"full-name\">(User Datagram Protocol)</span> / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">TLS</a></strong><small>Transport 연결</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#listeners-and-target-groups\">Listener</a></strong><small>고정 주소·Connection 분산</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#listeners-and-target-groups\">Target Group</a></strong><small>Network Workload</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\"><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#gateway-load-balancer\">Gateway Load Balancer</a>는 Network Appliance 경로, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#classic-load-balancer\">Classic Load Balancer</a>는 이전 세대다.</p></div></figure></section><section id=\"comparison\" class=\"wiki-section\"><h2>비교표</h2><div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"비교표\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Type</th><th scope=\"col\">Layer / Traffic</th><th scope=\"col\">주목적</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a></td><td>HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> / HTTPS <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure)</span></td><td>Host·Path 라우팅</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#network-load-balancer\">NLB</a></td><td>TCP <span class=\"full-name\">(Transmission Control Protocol)</span> / UDP <span class=\"full-name\">(User Datagram Protocol)</span> / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">TLS</a></td><td>Network 연결 분산</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#gateway-load-balancer\">GWLB</a></td><td>GENEVE Appliance Traffic</td><td>Security Inspection</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#classic-load-balancer\">CLB</a></td><td>이전 세대</td><td>기존 구성 유지</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"application-load-balancer\"><h2>Application Load Balancer<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span>·HTTPS <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure)</span>의 Layer 7에서 Host·Path 등으로 라우팅한다. Container·Microservice의 여러 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>, Redirect, Authentication과 WebSocket 지원에 적합하다. 일반적으로 고정 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>를 직접 지정하는 모델이 아니라 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> 이름으로 접근한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"network-load-balancer\"><h2>Network Load Balancer<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#network-load-balancer\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>TCP <span class=\"full-name\">(Transmission Control Protocol)</span>·UDP <span class=\"full-name\">(User Datagram Protocol)</span>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">TLS</a> 등 Layer 4 Traffic과 고성능 연결에 사용한다. 지원 방식으로 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>별 고정 주소·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">Elastic IP</a>를 구성할 수 있다. HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> Path를 읽어 여러 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>로 분기하는 목적은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>와 다르다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"gateway-load-balancer\"><h2>Gateway Load Balancer<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#gateway-load-balancer\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Firewall·IDS·Inspection 같은 Virtual Appliance에 Traffic을 분산한다. GENEVE로 Appliance Traffic을 전달하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#gateway-load-balancer\">GWLB</a> Endpoint를 Route 경로에 넣는다. 웹 사용자에게 페이지를 제공하는 일반 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>와 구별한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"classic-load-balancer\"><h2>Classic Load Balancer<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#classic-load-balancer\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>이전 세대 Load Balancer로 기존 구성에서 볼 수 있다. 신규 설계는 필요한 Layer와 기능에 따라 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#network-load-balancer\">NLB</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#gateway-load-balancer\">GWLB</a>를 우선 비교한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#classic-load-balancer\">CLB</a>의 기능을 최신 서비스와 동일하게 가정하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"listeners-and-target-groups\"><h2>Listeners and Target Groups<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#listeners-and-target-groups\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#listeners-and-target-groups\">Listener</a>는 수신 Protocol·Port와 처리 규칙을, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#listeners-and-target-groups\">Target Group</a>은 대상·Port·Health Check를 정의한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>, IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a> 등 지원 Target Type은 Load Balancer 종류별로 다르다. 서버가 실행 중이어도 Health Path가 실패하면 서비스에서 제외될 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"internet-facing-and-internal\"><h2>Internet-facing and Internal<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#internet-facing-and-internal\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Internet-facing은 Public 진입을, Internal은 Private Network 진입을 제공한다. Backend <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/#private-subnet\">Private Subnet</a>에 둘 수 있다. Load Balancer와 Target의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>·Route를 각각 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"cross-zone-load-balancing\"><h2>Cross-zone Load Balancing<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#cross-zone-load-balancing\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>수신 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>와 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 Target도 사용할지 결정한다. 기본 값과 설정 가능 위치는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#network-load-balancer\">NLB</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#gateway-load-balancer\">GWLB</a>마다 다르다. Target 분포와 교차 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 비용·장애 영향까지 고려한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"tls-stickiness-and-deregistration\"><h2>TLS <span class=\"full-name\">(Transport Layer Security)</span>, Stickiness and Deregistration<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#tls-stickiness-and-deregistration\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">TLS</a> 종료 위치는 Load Balancer 종류와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#listeners-and-target-groups\">Listener</a> Protocol에 따라 정한다. Stickiness는 세션 특성을 돕지만 외부 Session Store가 더 탄력적인 경우가 많다. Deregistration Delay는 종료 대상의 진행 중 요청을 마무리하는 데 사용한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>Host나 /api 경로로 서비스별 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>·Container를 선택해야 하면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>를 비교한다. 외부 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span> Allowlist와 TCP <span class=\"full-name\">(Transmission Control Protocol)</span> 연결이 핵심이면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#network-load-balancer\">NLB</a> 또는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/\">Global Accelerator</a> 구성을 검토한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>ELB <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Load Balancing)</span>는 서비스 계열, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#network-load-balancer\">NLB</a>는 개별 유형이다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/userguide/what-is-load-balancing.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">elasticloadbalancing/latest/userguide/what-is-load-balancing.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q024/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q024\" data-question=\"Q024\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q024</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q024/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Requests to /api and /images on the same domain must be routed to different backends based on their HTTP paths. Which load balancer type should be used?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q024\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Application Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q024\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q024\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q024\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>는 경로 기반 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> 라우팅을 지원한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a>만으로 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> 경로를 해석하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q033\" data-question=\"Q033\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q033</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q033/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A service requires TCP connections and fixed IP addresses but does not need HTTP path routing. Which load balancer should be considered first?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q033\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q033\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q033\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS WAF alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q033\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A Network Load Balancer</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#network-load-balancer\">NLB</a>는 L4 TCP <span class=\"full-name\">(Transmission Control Protocol)</span>/UDP <span class=\"full-name\">(User Datagram Protocol)</span> 연결 요구와 고정 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span> 요구에 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/\">Global Accelerator</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q066\" data-question=\"Q066\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q066</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q066/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to filter SQL injection patterns and excessive HTTP requests before they reach an ALB. Which service is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q066\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS STS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q066\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q066\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q066\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS WAF</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">WAF</a>가 웹 요청의 규칙·속도 기반 필터링에 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">WAF / Shield</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q084\" data-question=\"Q084\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1,2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q084</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q084/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which TWO components allow a stateless web tier to scale with demand and withstand an Availability Zone failure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q084\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EC2 instance with an Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q084\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer with targets in multiple AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q084\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling configured for multiple AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q084\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EBS volume shared from one AZ</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q084\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudTrail queries only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B, C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">ASG</a>가 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>별 용량을 유지·확장하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>가 건강한 대상으로 요청을 분산한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">EC2 Auto Scaling</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q097\" data-question=\"Q097\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q097</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q097/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An ALB must terminate browser HTTPS connections using a certificate that is issued and renewed as a managed service. What should be attached?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q097\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q097\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q097\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q097\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An ACM certificate</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">ACM</a>은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a> 같은 통합 서비스에서 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">TLS</a> 인증서를 관리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">ACM</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/\">이전 용어 <b>ElastiCache</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">다음 용어 <b>ENI</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
